---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About CC3PO — Built by a Tesla AI Trainer, Designed for Small Business" description="Meet Carlos Cabrales — former Tesla Vision team member who built CC3PO to give small businesses the same AI power that enterprises have. Our story, mission, and the village behind it all.">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0b;
      --bg-secondary: #111114;
      --bg-card: #141418;
      --text: #fff;
      --text-muted: #71717a;
      --text-secondary: #a1a1aa;
      --primary: var(--accent);
      --accent: #4fc3f7;
      --green: #00e676;
      --violet: #7c3aed;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --font: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: var(--font); background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; }
    .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    .hero { padding: 140px 24px 60px; text-align: center; }
    .hero-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 16px; background: rgba(107,53,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(107,53,255,0.3); border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .hero p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 40px; }

    .story { padding: 60px 24px; }
    .story-section { margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .story-section h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #fff; }
    .story-section p { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .story-section p strong { color: #fff; }

    .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; padding: 60px 24px; }
    .stat-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s; }
    .stat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(107,53,255,0.3); }
    .stat-number { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--violet)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; }

    .values { padding: 60px 24px; }
    .values-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
    .value-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; }
    .value-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .value-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .value-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }

    .cta { text-align: center; padding: 80px 24px; background: var(--bg-secondary); }
    .cta h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .cta p { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 500px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .btn-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 16px 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #c7384f); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(233,69,96,0.3); }
    .btn-secondary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 16px 32px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 12px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 16px; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .btn-secondary { margin-left: 0; margin-top: 12px; display: block; text-align: center; }
      .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 40px 16px; }
      .stat-card { padding: 20px 16px; }
      .stat-number { font-size: 2rem; }
      .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
      .value-card { padding: 24px 20px; }
      .timeline-step { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
      .timeline-number { width: 48px; height: 48px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
      .story-section h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; }
      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .faq-item { padding: 16px 0; }
      .hero { padding: 100px 20px 40px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .hero p { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .hero-badge { font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 4px 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .story { padding: 40px 16px; }
      .story-section { margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .story-section p { font-size: 0.95rem; }
      .values { padding: 40px 16px; }
      .cta { padding: 48px 20px; }
      .cta h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .hero { padding: 80px 16px 32px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .hero p { font-size: 0.9rem; }
      .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
      .stat-card { padding: 16px 12px; }
      .stat-number { font-size: 1.75rem; }
      .stat-label { font-size: 0.75rem; }
      .btn-primary, .btn-secondary { padding: 14px 24px; font-size: 0.9rem; width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">Built Different</div>
    <h1>I trained AI for Tesla.<br>Now I build AI that <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--violet));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">runs your business</span>.</h1>
    <p>CC3PO was built by Carlos Cabrales — an IT consultant who spent years training the vision models behind Tesla's self-driving technology. Now that same AI expertise is available to small businesses.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container story">
    <div class="story-section">
      <h2>From Tesla to Main Street</h2>
      <p>I worked on the <strong>Tesla Vision learning team</strong> under Andrej Karpathy's org, training the neural networks that power Tesla Autopilot and Full Self-Driving. I spent my days teaching machines to see the world — lane lines, stop signs, pedestrians, edge cases.</p>
      <p>What I learned there changed how I think about automation: <strong>the best systems don't just follow rules — they learn, adapt, and get better over time.</strong></p>
      <p>When I left Tesla, I started an IT consulting practice in Lathrop, California. I saw small businesses — dental offices, HVAC companies, auto shops — struggling with the same things over and over: website problems, compliance issues, reviews they couldn't keep up with, social media that never got posted.</p>
      <p>They couldn't afford a team. But a village? A village of specialists who never sleep, never forget, and never stop learning? That was possible.</p>
      <p>Carlos also runs <strong><a href="https://dontloseyourway.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;">Don't Lose Your Way</a></strong> — a reflection space for people who almost gave up. It's where this work comes from.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="story-section">
      <h2>Watch My Story</h2>
      <div style="position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:16px;">
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/AB-j3Fa5KYg" title="From Youth Programs to Mental Health Grants — Carlos' Story on Fantasy Turf War" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
      <p>I sat down with <strong>Fantasy Turf War</strong> to tell the story behind CC3PO. I started at <strong>20 years old</strong>, helping a youth technology program grow from <strong>3 locations to 16</strong> — serving <strong>150+ students</strong> with free computers and tech education. That experience became CC3PO's grant writing service, helping nonprofits fund the mental health and community programs that need it most.</p>
      <p>Want to hear how it all started and where it's going? <a href="/products/grant-writing/" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;">See how this became a service →</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="story-section">
      <h2>Why "CC3PO"?</h2>
      <p>The name comes from my initials — <strong>C3PO</strong> — but it's also a nod to the most helpful droid in the galaxy. One who speaks millions of languages, understands every system, and is always there when you need help.</p>
      <p>That's what this village does. We speak your business's language. We understand your systems. And we're always on.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="story-section">
      <h2>The Village Model</h2>
      <p>CC3PO isn't one AI. It's <strong>24 specialized agents</strong>, each with their own role, their own personality, and their own expertise. Like a real team — a social media manager, a compliance officer, a content writer, a lead handler — except they work 24/7 and coordinate automatically.</p>
      <p>Every agent has a name, a voice, and the freedom to choose what they care about. They write in their own style. They have opinions. They push back when something doesn't make sense. That's not a bug — that's the point.</p>
      <p><strong>We believe trust is earned, not claimed. Family over function. Build for generations, not just the next quarter.</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="story-section">
      <h2>Based in Lathrop, Serving California</h2>
      <p>CC3PO LLC operates from <strong>16299 Adobe Way, Lathrop, CA 95330</strong>. We're a <strong>CA Certified Small Business (SB #2052063)</strong>, <strong>Latino-Owned</strong>, and proud to serve all 58 California counties.</p>
      <p>We especially serve the Central Valley — Stockton, Lathrop, Manteca, Tracy, Modesto — because that's home. But our AI village works for businesses anywhere.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats container">
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-number">24</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Specialized AI Agents</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-number">24/7</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Always On</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-number">$497</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Starting Price/mo</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-number">14×</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Cheaper Than Hiring</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="values container">
    <h2 style="text-align:center;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:40px;">What We Believe</h2>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>Your Data, Your Rules</h3>
        <p>Your data never leaves your control. We don't sell it, share it, or train on it. Every action is logged. You always know what happened.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Human-First, AI-Powered</h3>
        <p>AI suggests. You decide. Every critical action goes through your approval. The village works for you, not instead of you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">🌍</div>
        <h3>Build for Generations</h3>
        <p>We build systems that outlast us. Not quarterly profit — generational value. The village is here for your kids' business too.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">🔄</div>
        <h3>Never Stop Evolving</h3>
        <p>Every agent gets smarter every session. The village that serves you today is better than the one that served you yesterday.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">💛</div>
        <h3>The Good Samaritan Principle</h3>
        <p>We build for others, not just ourselves. If it doesn't help someone, it doesn't belong here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3>Small Business, Big Power</h3>
        <p>You shouldn't need a Fortune 500 budget to get Fortune 500 technology. One price. One team. 24/7.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== LEARN FROM CARLOS / CLASSES ====== -->
  <section class="values container" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:60px;">
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px;">
      <span style="display:inline-block;padding:6px 16px;background:rgba(107,53,255,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(107,53,255,0.3);border-radius:100px;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);">Learn From Carlos</span>
    </div>
    <h2 style="text-align:center;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Build your own AI village.</h2>
    <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 40px;">I teach what I've actually built — not theory. From training AI at Tesla to running a 24-agent village for small businesses, I show you exactly how to build your own AI team that works while you sleep.</p>

    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">🎓</div>
        <h3>Group Classes</h3>
        <p>Live cohort sessions where you learn to build your own AI agents — step by step, with me. Perfect for aspiring freelancers, IT pros, and business owners who want to master automation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">🧑‍🏫</div>
        <h3>1:1 Coaching</h3>
        <p>Private mentoring for the serious builders. I'll help you design and launch your own automation system — your business, your tools, your village.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">🏛️</div>
        <h3>Local Workshops</h3>
        <p>In-person sessions in the Central Valley for small businesses, nonprofits, and aspiring AI consultants. Same approach that grew a youth program 3 → 16 locations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px;">
      <a href="/#cta" class="btn-primary">📅 Join a Class →</a>
      <a href="https://cc3po.io/strategy-call" class="btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">💬 Ask About Teaching</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <h2>Ready to meet your village?</h2>
    <p>Get a free business scan and see exactly where you stand. 30 seconds, no credit card.</p>
    <div>
      <a href="/#cta" class="btn-primary">🔍 Free Business Scan</a>
      <a href="/village/" class="btn-secondary">👥 Meet the Village</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>